
StremioBox rescue system (runs from RAM; Android is not mounted)
  sb-disk        check the Android partition, then mount it on /mnt/android
  sb-android     reboot into StremioBox
  /mnt/esp       EFI system partition (rescue files: /mnt/esp/efi/rescue)
  Wi-Fi:         put a wpa_supplicant config in efi/rescue/wifi.conf on the ESP

